@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-vn27-ch5-authorities`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Article 75: the responsibilities of the insurance enterprise, read in
-- full, as they bear on the compulsory motor insurance. Fourteen clauses: (1) no promotion or
-- payment discount; (2) reports; (3) the hotline; (4) the certificate look-up; (5) explaining
-- the cover; (6) information technology; (7) the claim file; (8) prompt payment; (9) the
-- police's copying costs and confidentiality; (10) the expiry notice; (11) contributing to the
-- Fund; (12) separate accounts; (13) the database; (14) other duties by law.
-- DECREE 220/2026 changes, in Article 75, only the name of the construction report in point
-- (a) of clause (2) ("hoạt động đầu tư xây dựng" becomes "hoạt động xây dựng") and, through its
-- Article 8(2), Form 3 of Annex X, the construction report: both outside this row's subject.
-- Every rule here answers the same in both vintages; the answer functions take the vintage and
-- force it (`the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:`) so that the tests run under both.
-- Deontic rules with no period in the source carry no WITHIN: inventing one would be writing
-- law. Their consequence is a breach with the clause as its reason.

§ `Article 75 — the responsibilities of the insurance enterprise`

-- src:1908 | Điều 75. Trách nhiệm của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm

§§ `Article 75(1) — no promotion, no payment discount`

-- "Không khuyến mại, chiết khấu thanh toán dưới mọi hình thức" (no promotion, no payment
-- discount, in any form) on the compulsory motor insurance. Beside it, Article 8(2) lets the
-- insurer raise or lower the Annex I premium by up to 15% on the claims history of the vehicle
-- or the accident history of the owner.
-- Fork V14: an adjustment on one of the grounds Article 8(2) gives, within 15% of the Annex I
--   premium, is pricing the decree permits, not a "discount" under clause (1); a reduction on
--   any other ground, or beyond 15%, is a discount in some form. The two clauses then meet
--   only at the stated ground, which nothing in the decree tests (finding R9).
-- Fork V15: the clause binds the insurer and the compulsory cover. A reduction in the price of
--   voluntary cover sold with it is not a discount "đối với bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân
--   sự của chủ xe cơ giới" on this reading (finding R10).
-- src:1909 | 1. Không khuyến mại, chiết khấu thanh toán dưới mọi hình thức đối với bảo
-- src:1910 | hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới.
-- src:235 | 2. Căn cứ vào lịch sử bồi thường bảo hiểm của từng xe cơ giới hoặc lịch sử
-- src:236 | gây tai nạn của chủ xe cơ giới, doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm chủ động xem xét, điều
-- src:237 | chỉnh tăng, giảm phí bảo hiểm. Mức tăng, giảm phí bảo hiểm tối đa là 15% tính
-- src:238 | trên mức phí bảo hiểm quy định tại Phụ lục I ban hành kèm theo Nghị định này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(2)
GIVEN ground IS A `A ground stated for the premium charged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 8(2) — a ground the clause gives:` ground MEANS
    CONSIDER ground
    WHEN `Article 8(2): the claims history of the vehicle`  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Article 8(2): the accident history of the owner`  THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                                                 FALSE

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(2): "tối đa là 15%"
GIVEN offer IS AN `An offer to sell the compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 8(2) — the adjustment is within 15% in` offer MEANS
        offer's `the premium the offer charges` AT LEAST (offer's `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term` TIMES 85%)
    AND offer's `the premium the offer charges` AT MOST  (offer's `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term` TIMES 115%)

-- The defects of an offer, in the order of the two clauses.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(1), Article 8(2); forks V14, V15
GIVEN v     IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      offer IS AN `An offer to sell the compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A defect of an offer`
`Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` v `, the defects of` offer MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
        mapMaybe (GIVEN p YIELD p) (LIST
            `only where` (NOT (null (offer's `benefits offered with the compulsory cover`)))
                `Article 75(1): a promotion is offered with the compulsory cover`,
            `only where` (offer's `the discount offered on payment` GREATER THAN 0)
                `Article 75(1): a payment discount is offered`,
            `only where` (`reduced` AND NOT `on an Article 8(2) ground`)
                `Article 75(1): the premium is reduced on a ground Article 8(2) does not give`,
            `only where` (`on an Article 8(2) ground` AND NOT (`Article 8(2) — the adjustment is within 15% in` offer))
                `Article 8(2): the premium is adjusted by more than 15% of the Annex I premium`,
            `only where` (`raised` AND NOT `on an Article 8(2) ground`)
                `Article 8(2): the premium is raised on a ground Article 8(2) does not give`))
    WHERE
        `reduced` MEANS offer's `the premium the offer charges` LESS THAN    offer's `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term`
        `raised`  MEANS offer's `the premium the offer charges` GREATER THAN offer's `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term`
        `on an Article 8(2) ground` MEANS `Article 8(2) — a ground the clause gives:` (offer's `the ground stated for the premium charged`)

-- The decision the clause makes: does the offer carry a promotion or a payment discount in
-- any form? A reduction Article 8(2) does not permit counts as a discount in some form (V14).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(1); fork V14
GIVEN v     IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      offer IS AN `An offer to sell the compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 75(1) — under` v `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` offer MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
            NOT (null (offer's `benefits offered with the compulsory cover`))
        OR  offer's `the discount offered on payment` GREATER THAN 0
        OR  (    offer's `the premium the offer charges` LESS THAN offer's `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term`
             AND (   NOT (`Article 8(2) — a ground the clause gives:` (offer's `the ground stated for the premium charged`))
                  OR NOT (`Article 8(2) — the adjustment is within 15% in` offer))))

-- The same clause as a standing prohibition on the insurer.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(1)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(1) — the insurer shall not offer a promotion or a payment discount` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    SHANT `offer a promotion or a payment discount on the compulsory motor insurance`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(1): a promotion or a payment discount was offered on the compulsory motor insurance"

§§ `Article 75(2)(a) — the report to the Ministry of Finance`

-- Point (a): the insurer makes and sends the Ministry of Finance, among others, the report on
-- the compulsory motor insurance on Form 1 of Annex X; the data run from 1 January to 31
-- December of the reporting year; the report is sent "chậm nhất là ngày 31 tháng 3" (at the
-- latest on 31 March) of the next financial year (that day included, fork V2), by hand, by
-- post, by email, or through the Ministry's reporting system once it is in operation.
-- The other reports of point (a) (Forms 2 and 3) and point (b) are fire and construction
-- insurance, outside this row. Form 1 is encoded below as a record; its unit for money is
-- the million đồng ("triệu đồng").
