@ref Decree 67/2023 Annex X, Form 1
GIVEN report IS A `A report on Form 1`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex X, Form 1 — the report has every vehicle line once, and its total adds up:` report MEANS
        all (GIVEN l YIELD count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `vehicle line` EQUALS l) (report's lines)) EQUALS 1) `the vehicle lines`
    AND count (report's lines) EQUALS 6
    AND all `the column adds up` `the columns`
    WHERE
        `the vehicle lines` MEANS LIST `I two-wheeled motorcycles`, `II three-wheeled motorcycles, mopeds and similar motor vehicles`, `III cars not used for transport business`, `IV cars used for transport business`, `V goods vehicles (trucks)`, `VI other vehicles`
        `the columns` MEANS LIST
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `number of vehicles`),
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `premium, in millions of dong`),
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `number of accidents`),
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `number of deaths`),
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `compensation for persons, in millions of dong`),
            (GIVEN f YIELD f's `compensation for property, in millions of dong`)
        `the column adds up` col MEANS
                sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD (col (r's figures))'s `at the beginning of the period`) (report's lines)) EQUALS (col (report's `the total`))'s `at the beginning of the period`
            AND sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD (col (r's figures))'s `at the end of the period`) (report's lines)) EQUALS (col (report's `the total`))'s `at the end of the period`

§§ `Article 75(3) — the hotline`

-- Set up and keep running, 24 hours a day and 7 days a week, a hotline to receive notice of
-- accidents and losses promptly and to guide and answer the buyer, the insured and others
-- concerned on the compulsory insurance; record the calls to it, to protect the buyer's and
-- the insured's interests. Article 12(1)(a) sends the buyer to this hotline at once after an
-- accident, and Article 12(2) starts the insurer's 1 hour and 24 hours from that notice
-- (row VN-10).
-- Fork V23: "24 giờ/7 ngày" is read as without interruption; the decree allows no hours of
--   closure, and every call must be recorded, not a sample.
-- src:1935 | 3. Thiết lập, duy trì hoạt động 24 giờ/7 ngày đường dây nóng để kịp thời tiếp
-- src:1936 | nhận thông tin tai nạn, tổn thất, hướng dẫn, giải đáp cho bên mua bảo hiểm, người
-- src:1937 | được bảo hiểm và các bên có liên quan về các vấn đề liên quan tới bảo hiểm bắt
-- src:1938 | buộc. Thực hiện ghi âm các cuộc gọi đến đường dây nóng để bảo đảm quyền lợi
-- src:1939 | của bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(3); fork V23
GIVEN hotline IS AN `An insurer's hotline`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Article 75(3) — what the hotline lacks:` hotline MEANS
    mapMaybe (GIVEN p YIELD p) (LIST
        `only where` (NOT (hotline's `operates 24 hours a day, 7 days a week`)) "it does not operate 24 hours a day, 7 days a week",
        `only where` (NOT (hotline's `receives notice of accidents and losses`)) "it does not receive notice of accidents and losses",
        `only where` (NOT (hotline's `guides and answers the buyer, the insured and others concerned on the compulsory insurance`)) "it does not guide and answer the buyer, the insured and others concerned",
        `only where` (NOT (hotline's `records the calls made to it`)) "the calls to it are not recorded")

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(3)
GIVEN v       IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      hotline IS AN `An insurer's hotline`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 75(3) — under` v `, the hotline meets the clause:` hotline MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
        null (`Article 75(3) — what the hotline lacks:` hotline))

§§ `Article 75(4) — looking up a certificate online`

-- Build a look-up of the compulsory motor certificates into the insurer's website or web
-- portal, so that the authorities that inspect and supervise, and the buyer and the insured,
-- can look up and verify the term and the validity of the cover on a certificate.
-- src:1940 | 4. Tích hợp tính năng tra cứu Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm
-- src:1941 | dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới trên trang thông tin điện tử, cổng thông tin điện tử của
-- src:1942 | doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, cho phép cơ quan có chức năng thanh tra, kiểm tra, giám
-- src:1943 | sát và bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm tra cứu, xác minh thời hạn và hiệu
-- src:1944 | lực bảo hiểm của Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(4)
GIVEN v      IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      lookup IS AN `An insurer's certificate look-up`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 75(4) — under` v `, the look-up meets the clause:` lookup MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
            lookup's `on the insurer's website or web portal`
        AND lookup's `open to the authorities that inspect and supervise`
        AND lookup's `open to the buyer and the insured`
        AND lookup's `shows the term of the insurance on the certificate`
        AND lookup's `shows whether the insurance on the certificate is in force`)

§§ `Article 75(5) — explaining the cover, compulsory against voluntary`

-- Explain clearly the conditions of insurance, the premium and the minimum sum insured, and
-- make sure the buyer and the insured clearly tell the compulsory insurance from the other,
-- voluntary insurances.
-- Fork V16: the compulsory motor insurance has no "số tiền bảo hiểm tối thiểu" (minimum sum
--   insured; that is a term of the fire and construction chapters, Articles 24 and 33); for the
--   motor insurance its place is taken by the limit of liability of Article 6, as Article 4(3)
--   itself pairs them ("số tiền bảo hiểm tối thiểu hoặc giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm").
-- The second limb is a duty of result ("bảo đảm ... phân biệt rõ": ensure that they tell them
--   apart clearly), recorded as a fact the buyer can attest (finding R12).
-- src:1945 | 5. Giải thích rõ điều kiện bảo hiểm, mức phí bảo hiểm, số tiền bảo hiểm tối
-- src:1946 | thiểu, bảo đảm bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm phân biệt rõ giữa loại
-- src:1947 | hình bảo hiểm bắt buộc với các loại hình bảo hiểm tự nguyện khác.
-- src:112 | 3. Ngoài việc tham gia bảo hiểm bắt buộc theo điều kiện bảo hiểm, mức phí
-- src:113 | bảo hiểm, số tiền bảo hiểm tối thiểu hoặc giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm quy định
-- src:742 | Điều 24. Số tiền bảo hiểm tối thiểu
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(5); fork V16
GIVEN v           IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      explanation IS A `What an insurer explained at the sale`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 75(5) — under` v `, the explanation meets the clause:` explanation MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
            explanation's `the conditions of the insurance, clearly`
        AND explanation's `the premium, clearly`
        AND explanation's `the minimum sum insured or, for the motor insurance, the limit of liability, clearly`
        AND explanation's `the buyer and the insured can tell the compulsory insurance clearly from voluntary insurance`)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(5)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(5) — the insurer must explain the cover` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST  `explain the insurance, and how it differs from voluntary insurance`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(5): the conditions, the premium and the limit were not explained clearly, or the buyer could not tell the compulsory from the voluntary insurance"

§§ `Article 75(6) — information technology`

-- Inert: "Tăng cường ứng dụng công nghệ thông tin" (increase the use of information
-- technology) in settling motor claims for motorcycles and mopeds sets no measure that any act
-- could meet or miss.
-- src:1948 | 6. Tăng cường ứng dụng công nghệ thông tin trong việc giải quyết bồi thường
-- src:1949 | bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới đối với mô tô, xe gắn máy.

§§ `Article 75(7) — the claim file`

-- Work with the buyer and others concerned to gather one claim file, and answer at law for its
-- accuracy, completeness and validity; gather on its own initiative the documents of the file
-- that are the insurer's to gather. Article 13, last paragraph, names them: the police
-- documents of Article 13(5) and the insurer's assessment record of Article 13(6) (with, under
-- Article 13(4)(a), the repair papers where the insurer repaired the damage itself).
-- No period is given (finding R11 on what this does to the time for payment).
-- src:1952 | 7. Phối hợp với bên mua bảo hiểm và các bên có liên quan để thu thập 1 bộ hồ
-- src:1953 | sơ bồi thường bảo hiểm và chịu trách nhiệm trước pháp luật về tính chính xác, đầy
-- src:1954 | đủ, hợp lệ của hồ sơ bồi thường bảo hiểm. Chủ động thu thập các tài liệu quy định
-- src:1955 | trong hồ sơ bồi thường bảo hiểm thuộc trách nhiệm của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm
-- src:1956 | quy định của Nghị định này.
-- src:447 | Bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm thu thập và gửi doanh
-- src:448 | nghiệp bảo hiểm các tài liệu quy định tại khoản 1, khoản 2, khoản 3, khoản 4 và
-- src:449 | khoản 7 Điều này. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm thu thập tài liệu quy
-- src:450 | định tại khoản 5 và khoản 6 Điều này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(7), Article 13 last paragraph
GIVEN `the insurer repaired or made good the damage itself` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Article 75(7) with Article 13 — the documents that are the insurer's to gather, the insurer having repaired the damage itself:` `the insurer repaired or made good the damage itself` MEANS
    IF   `the insurer repaired or made good the damage itself`
    THEN LIST "Article 13(4)(a): invoices or evidence of the repair or replacement",
              "Article 13(5): copies of the police documents on the accident, where Article 13(5) requires them",
              "Article 13(6): the insurer's assessment record"
    ELSE LIST "Article 13(5): copies of the police documents on the accident, where Article 13(5) requires them",
              "Article 13(6): the insurer's assessment record"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(7)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(7) — the insurer must gather its own claim documents` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST  `gather the claim documents that are the insurer's to gather`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(7): the insurer did not gather the claim documents that are its to gather"

§§ `Article 75(8) — prompt and accurate payment`

-- Advance and pay the compensation "nhanh chóng và chính xác" (promptly and accurately) under
-- this decree. The only period the decree gives is Article 12(3)'s 3 working days for the
-- advance (row VN-10); "nhanh chóng" adds none, so this rule carries no WITHIN (finding R11).
-- src:1957 | 8. Tạm ứng bồi thường, chi trả bồi thường bảo hiểm bắt buộc nhanh chóng và
-- src:1958 | chính xác theo quy định của Nghị định này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(8)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(8) — the insurer must advance and pay promptly and accurately` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST  `pay the advance and the compensation promptly and accurately`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(8): the advance and the compensation were not paid promptly and accurately"

§§ `Article 75(9) — the police's copying costs, and confidentiality`

-- Pay the police the cost of copying the files and records of a motor accident provided to it
-- under the law, and keep secret what it learns in the course of the investigation.
-- src:1959 | 9. Thanh toán cho cơ quan Công an chi phí sao chụp những hồ sơ, biên bản tai
-- src:1960 | nạn xe cơ giới đã được cung cấp theo quy định pháp luật và có trách nhiệm giữ bí
-- src:1961 | mật trong quá trình điều tra.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(9)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(9) — the insurer must pay for the copies and keep the investigation secret` MEANS
        (PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
         MUST  `pay the police the cost of copying the accident files provided`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
               BECAUSE "Article 75(9): the police were not paid the cost of copying the accident files")
    RAND
        (PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
         SHANT `disclose what it learns in the course of the investigation`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
               BECAUSE "Article 75(9): what the insurer learnt in the course of the investigation was not kept secret")

§§ `Article 75(10) — notifying the expiry`

-- Notify the buyer and the insured of the end of the contract's term "trong vòng 15 ngày
-- trước khi hết thời hạn bảo hiểm" (within 15 days before the term ends).
-- Fork V4: the days are calendar days (the decree writes "ngày làm việc" where it means working
--   days); the window is the 15 days before the day the certificate gives as the end of the
--   term: from that day less 15 to that day less 1. A notice earlier than the window is not
--   one the clause asks for (finding R13); one on the last day of cover is outside it.
-- Fork V19: both the buyer and the insured are notified (where they are one person, once).
-- src:1962 | 10. Thông báo cho bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm về việc hết thời
-- src:1963 | hạn của hợp đồng bảo hiểm trong vòng 15 ngày trước khi hết thời hạn bảo hiểm.
-- src:276 | g) Thời hạn bảo hiểm, phí bảo hiểm, thời hạn thanh toán phí bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(10); fork V4
GIVEN `the insurance ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 75(10) — the first day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on` MEANS
    `the insurance ends on` MINUS 15

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(10); fork V4
GIVEN `the insurance ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 75(10) — the last day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on` MEANS
    `the last day before` `the insurance ends on`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(10); forks V4, V19
GIVEN v                     IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      `the notice was sent on` IS A DATE
      `the insurance ends on`  IS A DATE
GIVETH AN EITHER `A defect in the facts given` BOOLEAN
`Article 75(10) — under` v `, a notice sent on` `the notice was sent on` `is in time for insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on` MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
        IF   `the notice was sent on` GREATER THAN `the insurance ends on`
        THEN LEFT `the notice is dated after the insurance ended`
        ELSE RIGHT (    `the notice was sent on` AT LEAST `Article 75(10) — the first day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on`
                    AND `the notice was sent on` AT MOST  `Article 75(10) — the last day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on`))

-- THE CLOCK of this rule is the date serial: a trace starts `AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD …))`. An
-- act before the window opens is a nullity (the obligation stays live).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(10); forks V4, V19
GIVEN `the insurance ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(10) — the insurer must notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on` MEANS
    PARTY  `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST   `notify the buyer and the insured that the insurance is about to expire`
    AFTER  (`Article 75(10) — the first day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on`)
    BEFORE (`Article 75(10) — the last day to notify the expiry of insurance ending on` `the insurance ends on`)
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
           BECAUSE "Article 75(10): the buyer and the insured were not notified of the expiry within the 15 days before the term ended"

§§ `Article 75(11) — contributing to the Fund`

-- Contribute to the Fund under Article 16 (encoded there, with its deadlines); the 1% of fire
-- premiums for fire prevention (Article 30) is fire insurance, outside this row.
