-- src:1967 | chữa cháy theo quy định tại Điều 30 Nghị định này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(11), Article 16(3)
GIVEN y     IS A NUMBER
      total IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(11) — the insurer must contribute to the Fund for` y `, of` total MEANS
    `Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` y `, of` total

§§ `Article 75(12) and (13) — separate accounts; the database`

-- (12) Account separately for the premium income, agents' commissions, claims and costs of the
-- compulsory insurance. (13) Provide and update information in the database of the compulsory
-- motor insurance as the Fund's Management Council requires. Neither gives a period.
