@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(12)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(12) — the insurer must account separately for the compulsory insurance` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST  `account separately for the compulsory insurance`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(12): premium income, agents' commissions, claims and costs of the compulsory insurance were not accounted for separately"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 75(13)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 75(13) — the insurer must provide and update the database` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST  `provide and update information in the database as the Council requires`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance enterprise`
          BECAUSE "Article 75(13): information was not provided or updated in the database as the Council required"

